  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_bubble",
      "name": {
        "en": "Bubble's Badge",
        "zh": "泡泡证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Bubble has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for preservation of the front and resilience against the enemy.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Defender Operator during field operations to exercise Protector responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员泡泡擅长维持战线抵御敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为重装干员，行使铁卫职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_bubble",
      "name": {
        "en": "Bubble's Shining Sword",
        "zh": "泡泡闪光必杀剑",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_bubble",
      "description": {
        "en": "Bubble is in a horrible mood.\nJust recently, she was watching the new animated film The Three Little Musketeers with some friends her age. Each of the heroes, seemingly just as young as them, had a shiny and glowy Originium blade and could use super-awesome techniques that made the whole screen flicker and shine like crazy, and it got everyone watching all pumped up. But then Shamare, who's always so cold, was there all alone like 'that sword's obviously just a toy' like she didn't get the mood at all.\nBubble wasn't one to say much about weapons, really. Swords were all light and fragile, and they'd never beat the cool stuff like giant axes and hammers.\nBut when she saw the friends she'd watched the film with get together one day and bring swords out, that really drove her nuts.\nThey were just like the ones in the movie! The shininess, the little button, and the dashing-ness that exuded from her friends when they lifted their swords to the air and yelled out the super-awesome move name.\nAnd like that, a need to HAVE overtook Bubble's heart.\nShe couldn't steal anyone's—she'd been scolded enough times already for that—but she had no idea how she'd get one like that for herself.\nBy buying it? How? From who? With what? She didn't even know how many rooms were inside this metal plate box, not to mention her friends were telling her they got shipped in from Kazimierz and she can't buy one now.\nWhy can't Bubble get the thing she wants?! It was all her mind could dwell on, but here she is now, and she doesn't know anything, except that aside from stealing someone else's she's got no way of getting the toy. But the lessons she's been having lately, and the sense of morals educated into her, stifle her urge to snatch one.\nSo now Bubble can only storm around in a huff, carelessly knocking into things and yelling loudly to vent her discontent. On occasion, when she tuckers herself out, she hides away in her dorm, crying as she hugs her tribe's totem.\nThis helplessness weighs down on Bubble very, very hard.\nMorte tastes this morsel and shares it with Shamare. After getting the rough gist of things, Shamare seeks out a psychological consultant operator at Medical, and very soon thereafter, a message is sent from HR out to Sargon...\nToday is Bubble's annual 'See Papa Day,' in which her father has agreed to come visit her once a year. It's the most important day of the year to her (aside from her birthday), and Bubble forces herself to shape up and look strong, to meet Papa with a smile. Even still, once she sees him, the gloom in her heart all spills out as tears, and she can't even put her words together properly, only lie in her Papa's arms and cry away.\nAfter the tears are done, she jumps out of her Papa's embrace, and sits silently on the couch again. And surprise! From his rucksack, her father pulls out a toy sword.\nIt's in this instant that Bubble's eyes shine like stars.",
        "zh": "泡泡的心情糟透了。\n最近，她和同龄伙伴们一起在看新动画片《三个小剑客》。里面每个和她们年龄相仿的小英雄都拿着一把闪闪发光的源石剑，还能放出超级酷炫，让整个屏幕疯狂闪烁的必杀技，所有人都看得热血沸腾。也就只有巫恋那个冷漠的家伙会在这时候插一句“那个剑一看就是玩具”这种不解风情的话。\n泡泡本来对武器没有什么想法。剑嘛，又轻又脆，肯定比不上大锤头大斧子这种硬派好东西。\n但是当见到一起看动画的朋友有一天当众掏剑时，她坐不住了。\n那把剑和动画里的一模一样！那个光效，那个小按钮，还有朋友一边将剑举向天空一边大喊必杀技的帅气模样。\n泡泡心里迅速升起了一股占有欲。\n肯定不能抢别人的，这点泡泡已经吃足教训了，但她又不知道怎么去获得这样的剑。\n买吗？怎么买？找谁买？用什么买？她连这个铁皮箱子有多少房间都不知道，更何况小伙伴和她说这个东西是从卡西米尔运来的，现在买不到。\n我泡泡想要的东西怎么能拿不到呢？！泡泡心里全是这种想法，但现实就摆在这里，她什么都不懂，除了抢别人的，确实没有获得玩具剑的办法。而最近获得的教训和培养起的道德，都在强压着她强抢别人玩具的冲动。\n于是泡泡只能自己憋着一股气，用胡乱冲撞和大喊大叫发泄自己的不满。偶尔，跑累打累了，就躲在宿舍里，一个人抱着部族图腾哭。\n这种无力感成为了泡泡身上的重负。\n小莫提品尝到这份食粮并将之分享给了巫恋。在大致了解了来龙去脉后，巫恋找到了医疗部的心理咨询干员，紧接着，一封通讯从人事部发往了萨尔贡……\n今天是泡泡每年一度的“见爸爸日”，她的父亲答应每年来看她一回，这是她在一年之中除生日外最重要的日子，泡泡让自己强行打起精神，用笑容面对爸爸。话虽如此，在见到爸爸后，心中的苦闷全都变成了泪水，话都说不利索，只好趴在爸爸怀里一个劲地哭。\n哭完了，她从爸爸怀里跳下来，沉默地坐回沙发。她的父亲则从背囊中抽出了一把玩具剑。\n就在那一瞬间，泡泡的双眼亮得像星星。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
